00:29:34,520 --> 00:29:37,180
Singular value decomposition, Tikhanov regularization.

503
00:29:38,120 --> 00:29:38,400
Right.

504
00:29:38,600 --> 00:29:41,280
Again, I need you to translate this into something we can grasp.

505
00:29:41,460 --> 00:29:43,040
Let's look at the problem we are facing.

506
00:29:43,360 --> 00:29:50,280
Because the projection destroyed so much information, reversing the process is what mathematicians call an ill-posed inverse problem.

507
00:29:50,360 --> 00:29:50,940
Ill-posed.

508
00:29:50,940 --> 00:29:55,640
It means there isn't just one single mountain range that could cast that specific 2D shadow.

